usage: eval_multiseed.py [-h] --checkpoints CHECKPOINTS [CHECKPOINTS ...]
                         --data_dir DATA_DIR --out OUT [--device DEVICE]
                         [--split {test,val}] [--starts STARTS]
                         [--seeds SEEDS] [--steps STEPS]
                         [--sampling_steps SAMPLING_STEPS] [--threads THREADS]
                         [--bootstrap BOOTSTRAP] [--seed0 SEED0]
                         [--bootstrap_seed BOOTSTRAP_SEED]

Paired start/seed evaluation with a cluster bootstrap over starting windows.
Physical metrics are calculated per surviving rollout using evaluate.py
conventions. CIs resample starts (all their seeds together), conditional on
the available test data.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoints CHECKPOINTS [CHECKPOINTS ...]
  --data_dir DATA_DIR
  --out OUT
  --device DEVICE
  --split {test,val}
  --starts STARTS
  --seeds SEEDS
  --steps STEPS
  --sampling_steps SAMPLING_STEPS
  --threads THREADS
  --bootstrap BOOTSTRAP
  --seed0 SEED0
  --bootstrap_seed BOOTSTRAP_SEED
